                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nkaambo kandinywe Zioni uyoolimwa mbuli muunda. Jerusalemu uyooba malwi malwi, acilundu cantempele ciyooba mbuli kalundulundu kamusokwe buyo.",
          "type": "text",
